OL,3,ASoftware glitch caused travel chaos,
OL,4,Asays air traffic control body
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe incident prompted questions over
OL,7,Fthe resilience of Nats' systems, and
OL,8,Fsome airlines questioned the position
OL,9,Fof its chief executive Martin Rolfe.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
