OL,3,APolice begin operation to move migrants
OL,4,Afrom Ceuta beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost of the 72,000 migrants who
OL,7,Fbreached the border from Morocco in
OL,8,FJuly have returned, but it is believed
OL,9,Fthat more than 13,000 remain in the
OL,10,Fenclave.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
