OL,3,ALindsay Clancy holdout juror had no
OL,4,Adoubt she deliberately killed her
OL,5,Achildren
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe lone holdout juror in the trial of
OL,8,FLindsay Clancy has said he "didn't have
OL,9,Fany doubts" that she was criminally
OL,10,Fresponsible for killing her three
OL,11,Fchildren.
OL,13,F"Based on all the physical evidence,
OL,14,Fkey witnesses and what the prosecution
OL,15,Fpresents, I thought it was enough proof
OL,16,Fthat she knew exactly what she was
OL,17,Fdoing and planned it," Michael
OL,18,FDesronvil said in a statement to CBS
OL,19,FNews, the BBC's US partner.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
