OL,3,AAt least 16 killed after vehicle loaded
OL,4,Awith explosives rams into Pakistan
OL,5,Amosque
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a statement, Pakistan's President
OL,8,FAsif Ali Zardari expressed "his best
OL,9,Fwishes for the swift recovery of those
OL,10,Finjured in the explosion."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
